OL,3,GNEWSA'Some think endometriosis is just
OL,4,Aa bad period, but it's so much worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen with endometriosis are being
OL,7,Fforced out of work, losing income and
OL,8,Ffacing significant financial hardship
OL,9,Fbecause of the condition, according to
OL,10,Fa new report by MPs.
OL,12,FThe inquiry by the All-Party
OL,13,FParliamentary Group on Endometriosis,
OL,14,Fsupported by Endometriosis UK, found
OL,15,F47% of women with the condition had
OL,16,Flost income because of their symptoms,
OL,17,Fwhile 28% had left a job altogether.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
