OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Some think endometriosis is just
OL,4,Aa bad period, but it's so much worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong them was Chloe Ward, from Bolton,
OL,7,Fwho said her endometriosis - which can
OL,8,Fcause severe pain, fatigue, heavy
OL,9,Fbleeding and fertility problems - had
OL,10,Fcost her thousands of pounds and
OL,11,Faffected her ability to run her own
OL,12,Fbusiness.
OL,14,FShe said: "A lot of people think it's
OL,15,Fjust a bad period, but it's so much
OL,16,Fworse."
